L06|News and messages|Treaty block|"B sues A for peace and;" followed by three indented lines (ends all trading agreements, ends all alliances, pays reparations of N talents) and "A and B have agreed to end their war.". [code] The agreed-to-end-their-war line is also written for each ally that follows.|an instant battle between two AI nations where the loser has unity above 500 and more than 7 cities, 2 in 5 (the human post-battle dialog is row D09 and is always honourable)|SS:FI_b1_01_main.png (Ptolemaic sues Seleucid ... 2,242 talents); X:FUN_00450c68; R:news-log-format-and-messages.md Q4 #14-#18|[confirmed]|useful
