L10|News and messages|Confirmation boxes|Yes / No / Cancel questions. Seen: lead a different nation, abdicate, attack a fleet, scuttle a fleet. [code only] start a new game, quit, attack a city or army (a city prompt was seen: B2_PEACE_GENUA_*), disband (army, unit); surrender belongs to the excluded battle.|the order that asks|SS:FI_b1_09_game_newnation.png, FI_b1_10_game_abdicate.png; coverage.md §3 Attack rows (attack this fleet: PP_yes_seed1.SAV); X:TPremierForm_NewGame, TPremierForm_CheckQuit, TUnitMap_SelectUnit, TUnitMap_DisbandArmy, TUnitMap_ScuttleFleet, TArmyRecruits_DisbandUnits, TChangeArmyUnits_Disband|[confirmed]|useful
